Package: abra
Title: OBIS Area-Based Records Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Silas", "Principe", , "s.principe@unesco.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Area based analysis of marine records from OBIS. Set an area, period, taxa and a grid on a robisdb connection, and run analyses such as basic statistics and information metrics.
